          "block_id": "p01-b001",
          "kind": "heading",
          "level": 1,
          "order": 0,
          "text": "Welcome to Maple Grove High School"
        },
        {
          "block_id": "p01-b002",
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "level": null,
          "order": 1,
          "text": "Maple Grove High School serves about 640 students in grades 9 through 12 in the Maple Grove Local School District. Our mission is to prepare every student for college, career and community life."
        },
        {
          "block_id": "p01-b003",
          "kind": "list",
          "level": null,
          "order": 2,
          "text": "News and Announcements\nFall parent teacher conferences are November 12 and 13.\nThe Mustangs marching band placed second at the state competition.\nSenior photos are due to the main office by December 1."
        },
        {
          "block_id": "p01-b004",
          "kind": "contact",
          "level": null,
          "order": 3,
          "text": "Questions? Call the main office at (555) 010-0142."
        },
        {
